{% doc %}
  @prompt
    请在我的 Shopify 产品系列模板里，新增一个轻量文字说明区块，用于介绍 Metal Aluminum Fan Staves & Hardware Kits 的配件包。不要使用大图片，不要占太多页面高度，整体风格要简洁、高级、适合移动端。
    
    区块位置放在：
    
    Product Grid 下方，42 Standard Color Options 上方。
    
    区块名称 / 标题：
    
    Hardware Kit Included
    
    区块内容请使用 4 个小卡片或图标文字项展示，如果模板支持 icons，请使用简洁线性图标；如果不支持图片或图标，就用文字卡片。
    
    请按下面内容制作：
    
    Intro text:
    Each aluminum fan stave set includes the essential hardware needed for DIY feather fan frame assembly.
    
    Card 1 Title:
    Pivot Bolt
    Card 1 Text:
    Used for the main fan joint.
    
    Card 2 Title:
    Locking Bolt + Nut
    Card 2 Text:
    Helps keep the fan open and stable.
    
    Card 3 Title:
    Washers Included
    Card 3 Text:
    Plastic and iron washers for smoother assembly.
    
    Card 4 Title:
    DIY Accessories
    Card 4 Text:
    Wire, needle, and wax line included.
    
    在 4 个卡片下面增加一行小提示文字：
    
    Both bolt types are included: the pivot bolt is used for the main fan joint, while the locking bolt helps keep the fan open and stable during use.
    
    设计要求：
    
    不要使用大图
    不要让这个区块太高
    桌面端显示为 4 列
    手机端显示为 2 列或 1 列
    背景使用浅色或白色
    标题用 H2
    文字保持简洁清晰
    风格与页面整体的 premium / elegant / clean 视觉一致
    如果有 Section style，使用简洁白底或浅色背景
    Padding 不要太大，保持中等即可, 每一个Card 设计可以加入小图片，
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-hardware-kit-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-hardware-kit-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-hardware-kit-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .ai-hardware-kit-intro-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.intro_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
    opacity: 0.9;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-hardware-kit-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-hardware-kit-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 20px 16px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-hardware-kit-card-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.image_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.image_size }}px;
    margin: 0 auto 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-hardware-kit-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .ai-hardware-kit-card-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: 4px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-hardware-kit-card-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-hardware-kit-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_title_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .ai-hardware-kit-card-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0.85;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-hardware-kit-note-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.note_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0.75;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-hardware-kit-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .ai-hardware-kit-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.heading_size }}px * 0.85);
    }

    .ai-hardware-kit-intro-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.intro_size }}px * 0.9);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .ai-hardware-kit-card-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: calc({{ block.settings.image_size }}px * 0.85);
      height: calc({{ block.settings.image_size }}px * 0.85);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-hardware-kit-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top | times: 0.7 }}px 16px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-hardware-kit-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .ai-hardware-kit-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 16px 14px;
    }

    .ai-hardware-kit-card-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: calc({{ block.settings.image_size }}px * 0.75);
      height: calc({{ block.settings.image_size }}px * 0.75);
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-hardware-kit-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-hardware-kit-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
      <h2 class="ai-hardware-kit-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.intro_text != blank %}
      <div class="ai-hardware-kit-intro-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.intro_text }}</div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-hardware-kit-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.card_1_title != blank %}
        <div class="ai-hardware-kit-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-hardware-kit-card-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.card_1_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.card_1_image | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.card_1_title | escape }}"
                class="ai-hardware-kit-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="200"
                height="200"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-hardware-kit-card-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          <h3 class="ai-hardware-kit-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.card_1_title }}</h3>
          {% if block.settings.card_1_text != blank %}
            <p class="ai-hardware-kit-card-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.card_1_text }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.card_2_title != blank %}
        <div class="ai-hardware-kit-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-hardware-kit-card-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.card_2_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.card_2_image | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.card_2_title | escape }}"
                class="ai-hardware-kit-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="200"
                height="200"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-hardware-kit-card-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          <h3 class="ai-hardware-kit-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.card_2_title }}</h3>
          {% if block.settings.card_2_text != blank %}
            <p class="ai-hardware-kit-card-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.card_2_text }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.card_3_title != blank %}
        <div class="ai-hardware-kit-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-hardware-kit-card-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.card_3_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.card_3_image | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.card_3_title | escape }}"
                class="ai-hardware-kit-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="200"
                height="200"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-hardware-kit-card-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          <h3 class="ai-hardware-kit-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.card_3_title }}</h3>
          {% if block.settings.card_3_text != blank %}
            <p class="ai-hardware-kit-card-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.card_3_text }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.card_4_title != blank %}
        <div class="ai-hardware-kit-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-hardware-kit-card-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.card_4_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.card_4_image | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.card_4_title | escape }}"
                class="ai-hardware-kit-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="200"
                height="200"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-hardware-kit-card-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          <h3 class="ai-hardware-kit-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.card_4_title }}</h3>
          {% if block.settings.card_4_text != blank %}
            <p class="ai-hardware-kit-card-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.card_4_text }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    {% if block.settings.note_text != blank %}
      <p class="ai-hardware-kit-note-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.note_text }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>

